    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Two pointers</span><span class=\"chip accent\">In-place filter</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/remove-element/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 27</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Remove Element</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">A reader scans every value; a writer marks the end of the kept part. Copy each value that is not <code>val</code> to the writer's slot and return the writer as k. O(n) time, O(1) space. When removals are rare, overwrite each hit with the last element instead and do fewer writes.</p>\n"
